000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PAYEXTR.
000300 AUTHOR. TRSYDEMO.
000400*
000500* EXTRACT APPROVED USD PAYMENTS INTO A CONTROLLED BANK FILE.
000600*
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000900 FILE-CONTROL.
001000     SELECT RUN-CONTROL ASSIGN TO RUNCTL
001100         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
001200         FILE STATUS IS WS-RUNCTL-STATUS.
001300     SELECT DISBURSEMENT-OUT ASSIGN TO DISBOUT
001400         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
001500         FILE STATUS IS WS-DISB-STATUS.
001600     SELECT EXCEPTION-OUT ASSIGN TO EXCEPT
