033700     MOVE HV-DEBIT-ACCOUNT TO PAY-DTL-DEBIT-ACCOUNT
033800     MOVE HV-BENEFICIARY-NAME(1:30) TO PAY-DTL-BENE-NAME
033900     MOVE HV-BANK-ROUTING TO PAY-DTL-ROUTING
034000     MOVE HV-BANK-ACCOUNT TO PAY-DTL-BANK-ACCOUNT
