037500     MOVE WS-EXCEPTION-CODE TO RX-CODE HV-EXCEPTION-CODE
037600     MOVE HV-AMOUNT TO RX-EXPECTED-AMOUNT
037700     MOVE ZERO TO RX-ACTUAL-AMOUNT
